# Cloudflare Workers static-assets exclude list (gitignore syntax).
# The deployed site is the pre-built root index.html. These are only the
# machinery used to generate it, so they don't need to ship. Data CSVs under
# data/ are intentionally NOT excluded (kept downloadable, as before).
versions/
data/compute.py
data/records.json
__pycache__/
README.md
worker.mjs
data/revisions/*/records.json
